==== SOURCE NOTES - not part of the post. Paste from the line after "POST BEGINS" to the end. ====

The KMU thread on Fossic (https://www.fossic.org/), the Chinese Starsector forum, in its 原创 board
(Mod制作发布, forum-71-1.html). It is forum-post.bbcode with the same sections in the same order,
in Simplified Chinese by localisation/zh-hans/README.md, the terminology reference.
How a KM mod's thread on that board works - the board and its review, the posting form, the rules,
the Discuz markup, images and attachments - is KMLib's docs/dev/fossic-thread.md.
This file holds only what is KMU's: what its post leaves out or adds, its form values, its links
and its release checklist.

fossic-post.pairs.md pairs every line of this post with the Fractal Softworks post's for review;
change it with this file. FossicPostPairingIntegrationTests holds the two together.

Why the post differs from the English one, beyond the language:
- The download is a forum attachment, by the board's rules: the zh-hans zip and, since KMLib has no thread
  of its own, KMLib's zip too, under 前置. GitHub appears once, as a source line, because github.com is
  unreliable from China and a player here cannot depend on it.
- Every image and zip is a forum attachment. Each [attachimg]promo/zh-hans/<file>[/attachimg] below names the image
  under promo/zh-hans/ to upload, and each [attach]<zip>[/attach] the release zip; after the upload, replace the name
  with the attachment ID the editor inserts. A zip's tag puts its download link in the line that names it,
  where an untagged attachment would show only in the list under the post.
- No shields badges and no TriOS link: both resolve through GitHub, and the counters would count GitHub
  downloads while the attachment is the main download here. The manual install line, from
  nexus-post.bbcode, stands in for TriOS.
- The Bad Apple question is left out: its video is on Reddit and YouTube, both blocked in mainland China.
- A screenshot with no Chinese version yet is left out, with its caption, as an accepted gap; the sector
  example is the one Chinese screenshot of its own, vanilla with Nexerelin.
- The post-release roadmap is left out. It moves as plans do, so it is kept in the Fractal Softworks post
  alone, and this post has that much less to keep current.
- The post opens with its title rather than the banner, so its first line is text, not an image that may
  not load. The banner is its own Chinese variant, promo/zh-hans/always-has-been.png from always-has-been.psd:
  "map game" becomes P社游戏, the players' word for the genre the joke points at.
- The Chinese core localisation the zip needs heads the 前置 list, since that is the one thing a player on
  this board must do that a player on the other board need not. It is named there once, where a player
  installing the mod looks for what else to install.

What the board's rules ask of this mod in particular:
- No known conflicting mod, so the form's 冲突Mod and the post name none.
- Nothing to disclose under the rule on modifying the game, going online or writing outside the game
  folder: KMU and KMLib make no network calls, and KMLib's one write goes through the game's own
  common-data store, inside the game folder.
- Under the rule that feeding another author's work to a large language model is using that work: KMU's
  research read the code of the mods it works with. LazyLib (its licence file), Nexerelin (MIT), LunaLib
  (CC BY 4.0) and Fast Rendering (the Unlicense) permit that; Random Assortment of Things states no terms.

Posting form values (what each input takes is in the KMLib doc; * is required):
  标题 *                [0.98a][测试] 政治地图 - 星图图层 - KMU
  Mod标识符 *           kmu
  Mod中文名 *           政治地图 - 星图图层 - KMU
  Mod英文名             Political Map - Sector Map Layers - KMU
  Mod作者 *             Klark Morrigan
  Mod类别 *             杂项: the category guide (thread 5932) keeps 功能 for mods removable mid-save, and KMU's
                        kept save needs the uninstall procedure, as 可安全移除 否 says
  Mod适用版本 *         0.98
  Mod更新时间 *         the release date
  Mod版本 *             the version in mod_info.base.json
  可安全移除 *          否
  依赖Mod *             LunaLib, LazyLib and 其它; 势力争霸(Nexerelin) unticked, being optional
  其它依赖Mod           KMLib
  冲突Mod               empty
  Mod简短介绍 *         星图上的政治地图叠加层（星图界面、情报信息界面等），为势力、联盟（需 Nexerelin）和星系宣称上色。
  Mod下载地址           empty
  网盘提取码/解压密码   empty
  Mod语言 *             中文
  Mod发布文件           one row: KMU-<version>-zh-hans.zip, 游戏版本 0.98, Mod版本 as above,
                        显示名称 KMU <version> 简体中文版. KMLib's zip gets no row
  Mod允许直链下载 *     是
  Mod索引隐藏           否
  Mod索引备注           需先安装中文汉化
  主题标签              mod发布, 星图, 政治地图, 势力争霸, KMU
  回帖奖励              empty, as the KMLib doc says
  定时发布              none
  附加选项              as the KMLib doc says

