Once, after the first post: put this thread's URL into forum-post.bbcode and nexus-post.bbcode, in place
of their <<the KMU thread on Fossic ...>> placeholders, so the English posts link here.

Release checklist, run by hand on every KMU release:
  1. Upload KMU-<version>-zh-hans.zip, put its ID in the 下载 line's [attach] tag, add its Mod发布文件 row,
     and remove the previous version's row and file. Where KMLib moved, upload KMLib-<version>-zh-hans.zip
     and put its ID in the 前置 line's tag the same way.
  2. Set the form's Mod版本, Mod适用版本 and Mod更新时间, and the version in the 下载 line.
  3. Paste the version's section of localisation/zh-hans/CHANGELOG.md into the 更新日志 spoiler,
     above the previous versions, so the newest is first.
  4. The editor has no preview: save a draft (保存草稿) and open it once.
     Check [hr] renders and the nested spoilers open.

